WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.190
It's too bad that before I 
can beat you in this duel...

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:11.160
...this bridge will vanish 
and sink you into the abyss.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:16.100
Playmaker...

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.330
Yusaku...

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.660
What's so funny?

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.780
Because you failed to defeat me by dueling.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:32.980
When Revolver finds out, 
he'll be disappointed.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.680
That it wasn't a duel that ended me.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:41.520
Oh nooo!

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.420
I changed my mind.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:54.770
Playmaker, I'll end you personally!

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:14.760
I run Across the universe

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.930
At the speed of light

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:19.800
Begin Loading

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.540
Open the door of dreams

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:27.110
VRAINS spreads

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:30.210
Believe in myself

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:33.750
VRAINS continues

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:39.060
The circuit draws the future

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:43.130
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:44.730
Access!

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:47.430
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:49.030
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.330
Link with my soul

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:54.100
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:55.840
Now Win the Race

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:58.680
Connected world

00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:02.180
No matter when

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:05.550
Nothing is impossible

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:09.690
Strive for hope

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:14.270
And ride the wind!

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:33.830
The duel continues!  As does our coverage!

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:37.760
If Playmaker loses, the 
network will be destroyed!

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:40.360
We need him to win!

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:46.350
Playmaker, you can't defeat me in a duel.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:49.080
I'll prove that right now.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:58.100
My mother tree Sunavalon, the captured 
Zaizen, and your lame sense of justice.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:02.240
As long as they exist, you can't win!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.970
Not even by a long shot.

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:07.970
Playmaker, forget about me!

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:12.720
Or Aoi's sacrifice would be for nothing.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:17.320
I set one card and end my turn.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:25.720
Will you try to deal me damage 
next turn by forsaking him?

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:29.920
You cheater!  You really play dirty!

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.930
Cheater?  Dirty?

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:35.940
Those are wonderful words of praise.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:38.930
Instead of misled by a 
dumb sense of justice...

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:44.120
...it's more wonderful to do 
dirty tricks to fulfill my goal.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:48.070
Yes.  Everything I do is for Revolver.

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:49.860
I hate you.

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.790
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:54.130
So you'll attack me?

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:56.260
Please do so!

00:03:57.890 --> 00:04:00.920
I set a card and end my turn.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:04.520
Huh?  You won't do anything?

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:08.830
I was prepared to take your attack.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:10.200
Seriously?

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.040
Yusaku...

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:16.810
The LVSS I gave Yusaku...

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:21.920
Even though it doesn't work perfectly, 
it's equipped with an emergency escape.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:26.210
Maybe it can save Zaizen.

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:30.850
Then I'll do whatever I like.

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:32.190
My turn!

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:37.440
Let's battle!  Sunvine Thrasher 
attacks Excode Talker!

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:41.090
Playmaker has 900 LP.

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:44.060
If Excode Talker is destroyed...

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:49.580
Playmaker!  Your fate - 
and your life - are over!

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:51.890
Hey!  You'll run out of LP!

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.800
The Continuous Trap, Overload Anchor!

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:58.840
Excode Talker isn't destroyed 
in battle, and damage is halved.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.740
And the battle ends.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:08.180
I can't watch this.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:10.120
Your useless last stand?

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:13.100
We're only getting started!

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.090
Do whatever you want.

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:21.700
But don't forget that damaging 
me brings his end closer.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:25.340
Hey, Playmaker!

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:29.840
By using Overload Anchor to stop 
destruction and halve the damage...

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:32.840
...you can use another effect this turn.

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:39.200
By banishing Overload Anchor, his Link 
Monster's ATK are halved until his next turn.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:40.590
Yeah, that one!

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:45.020
If you lower Thrasher's ATK 
and battle next turn...

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:46.840
...you can deal him damage!

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.560
Huh?  You're not gonna do that?

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:54.520
Truly a wonderful sense of justice.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:59.060
But as a duelist, you're second-rate.

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:02.080
I end my turn.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:04.540
Hey, Playmaker!

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:06.780
Don't you understand the situation?

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:11.020
If you lose, that tower will be completed!

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:15.040
I don't want to die along with Zaizen!

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:17.480
Are you two having a falling out?

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:20.740
Shouldn't you die together as friends?

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.320
It's not the end!  My turn!

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:29.330
From my hand, I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Link Processing Failure!

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:33.200
I select one Link Monster on my field.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:38.340
Link Monsters with equal or fewer Link 
Markers and other monsters can't attack.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.360
What?

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:43.240
I select Link 3 Excode Talker!

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:46.480
This card will be destroyed in two turns.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:51.440
All of Spectre's monsters 
are Link 3 or lower.

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:54.960
He can avoid destruction 
and battle damage, but...

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:56.460
Pointless.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:07:00.970
Since you can't attack me, 
everything you do is pointless.

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:03.370
It's hard to watch.

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:05.440
I end my turn.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.780
He's right.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:11.700
Can you make a comeback by drawing this out?

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:15.300
Playmaker, forget about Zaizen and fight!

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:19.080
If you lose, the world will be in chaos!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.100
You're its final hope!

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:23.040
Playmaker!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.930
Will I finish in time...

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:35.240
I can't watch you two quarrel anymore.

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:40.140
Allow me to end this.  My turn!

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:44.820
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:48.820
The summoning conditions are at 
least two Plant Link Monsters!

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:55.060
I set Link 1 Sunvine Thrasher 
and Link 3 Sunavalon Dryanome!

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:58.500
Link Summon!

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:04.460
Appear, Link 4 Sunavalon Dryatrentiay!

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:08.620
It's Link 4!

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:12.380
Link Processing Failure's effect won't work!

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.380
But it has 0 ATK.

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:17.240
Dryatrentiay's effect activates!

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:23.250
Once per turn, by tributing a 
Plant monster next to her link...

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:30.500
...for every Link Marker she has, a faceup 
spell and trap card on your field is destroyed.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:34.680
I tribute Link 2 Sunavalon Daphne.

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:39.220
I destroy Overload Anchor 
and Link Processing Failure!

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:44.940
No!  Now if he summons a Link 
Monster, we're done for!

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:48.910
The Continuous Spell Sunvine 
Shrine's effect activates!

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:56.540
Once per turn, I Special Summon a Level 4 or 
lower Plant Normal Monster from the graveyard.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:59.560
Come, Sunseed Genius Loci!

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:07.240
Appear again!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:11.760
The summoning condition is 
one Plant Normal Monster.

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:14.500
I set Genius Loci!

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:16.530
Link Summon!

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:20.540
Appear, Link 1 Sunvine Thrasher!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:22.980
Thrasher's effect activates!

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:31.070
Since it's linked to Sunavalon, it gains 800 
ATK for each of Sunavalon's Link Markers.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:33.220
Dryatrentiay is Link 4.

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:36.200
So it gains 3200 ATK!

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.160
Hey!  That thing's dangerous!

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:44.170
But when Dryatrentiay's 
effect destroys your card...

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:48.140
...monsters in my Main Monster 
Zone can't attack that turn.

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:51.820
Phew!  we're safe!

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.470
His Thrasher can't attack.

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:55.480
Are you sure?

00:09:56.780 --> 00:10:01.890
He wouldn't summon a monster that can't 
attack and raise its ATK for no reason.

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:06.600
No wonder you're a veteran, 
Playmaker.  Impressive!

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:08.990
Of course I have a reason!

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:13.230
I activate the Continuous 
Trap, Sunavalon Bloom!

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:19.230
When this card activates, your 
monsters' effects are negated.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:25.610
The link that Excode Talker blocked is back!

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:28.180
You have 450 LP.

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:32.080
My giant mother tree will 
deal the final strike.

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:36.250
Hey!  How can you attack with 0 ATK?

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:42.090
Let's battle!  Sunavalon Dryatrentiay 
attacks Excode Talker!

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:51.370
When Dryatrentiay battles, she gains ATK equal 
to the total ATK of monsters next to her links.

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:55.640
She gains Thrasher's 4000 ATK.

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:58.340
This is bad!

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:01.580
This is the finale!

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:05.280
Hey!  What will you do, Playmaker?

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:06.840
I was waiting for this.

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:08.060
What?

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:10.800
The trap card, Link Surge Counter!

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:15.880
If your Link Monster has more 
Link Markers than mine...

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:21.020
...by banishing two spell and trap 
cards on my field or graveyard...

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:26.800
...Excode Talker's ATK become the same as 
your Link Monster until the end of battle!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:33.380
I banish Overload Anchor and Link 
Processing Failure from my graveyard!

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:39.110
I see.  It's your final pointless move.

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:47.790
But if I use Sunavalon Force's effect to 
destroy your monster, you take 400 damage!

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:59.370
All right!  You dodged defeat!

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:02.140
But you only have 50 LP left.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:05.370
No matter what you try next turn-

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:25.860
Since Dryatrentiay is destroyed, your own 
effect destroys all cards on your field!

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:34.570
Exhilarating!

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:39.310
Sunavalon can't be attacked.

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:44.910
It's near impossible for me to 
destroy your impenetrable combo.

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:49.790
But if you're the one who 
attacks, it's a different story.

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:55.520
Destroy all his monsters without 
dealing damage?  Well done!

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:59.990
Your mommy can't protect you anymore.

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:02.400
Here comes the comeback!

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:02.990
Playmaker-

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:04.830
How dare you!

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:07.900
My sacred mother tree!

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:10.700
He's maaad!

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:15.350
I activate the Continuous Spell, 
Sunavalon Cursed Reborn!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:22.410
I Special Summon a Sunavalon Link Monster 
from the graveyard by negating its effects!

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:25.820
Resurrect, Dryatrentiay!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:31.280
I'm sorry!  Forgive me, mommy!

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:45.000
Due to Cursed Reborn's additional effect, 
Dryatrentiay gains 1000 ATK for every Link Marker!

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:48.000
Dryatrentiay has 4 Link Markers.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.800
Therefore, it gains 4000!

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:59.960
I'll stop being bad, mommy.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:03.520
Cursed Reborn has another effect.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:11.190
If I take battle or effect damage, 
you take the same amount!

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:15.270
Playmaker, your defeat is assured.

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:18.280
I end my turn.

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:23.530
This is why you should have forsaken Zaizen!

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:27.230
All right!

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.090
What's this?

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:36.910
It's Kusanagi.

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:39.520
Well done for him!

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:43.490
You think that'll work?

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:53.440
It's impossible to destroy that system!

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:56.810
Damn!

00:14:57.360 --> 00:15:02.820
Victory and his fate are in my hands!

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.160
Playmaker!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:10.280
If you're stuck in doubt, it'll 
only lead to more victims!

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:15.200
Or else, my sister did 
everything for nothing.

00:15:15.570 --> 00:15:17.660
Have conviction, Playmaker!

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:19.890
Don't lose track of the big picture!

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:24.200
Even if sacrifices must 
be made along the way...

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:26.240
...carry that burden and keep going!

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:30.980
Go!  Transform that conviction into strength!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.450
Don't do it!

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:42.420
What?  He did it to himself?

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.390
No way!

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:48.860
Aoi...

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:53.570
I'll coming to you.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:56.830
Let's go home together.

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:02.840
Playmaker, I leave the rest to you.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.180
Damn!

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:12.690
Seriously?

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:17.680
What a complete fool.

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:21.710
Entrusting someone who can't win.

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:24.330
Can't win?

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:29.300
You have the wrong idea.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:33.110
My dueling always wins.

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:38.040
And Zaizen gave me the 
opportunity to escape my doubt!

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:43.610
I'll live up to his wishes by winning!

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:47.250
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:50.990
I summon ROM Cloudia!

00:16:53.480 --> 00:17:01.110
When it's summoned, its effect adds one 
Cyberse monster in my graveyard to my hand!

00:17:01.110 --> 00:17:03.430
I add Latency!

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:06.170
And Latency's effect!

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:11.410
Once per turn, I can Special Summon it when 
it's added from my graveyard to my hand!

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:13.450
Come, Latency!

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:18.840
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:23.840
The summoning condition is 
one Level 2 or lower Cyberse!

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:27.290
I set Level 1 Latency!

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:28.760
Link Summon!

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:33.330
Appear, Link 1 Talkback Lancer!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:38.100
Latency's additional effect!

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:44.660
When it's Special Summoned by its own effect 
and used to Link Summon, I draw one card!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.720
I activate Talkback Lancer's effect!

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:55.280
By tributing a Cyberse, I Special Summon a 
Code Talker from my graveyard next to its link!

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:57.520
I tribute ROM Cloudia!

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:01.200
Excode Talker returns!

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:07.100
Excode Talker's effect activates!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:11.570
The monster next to its link gains 500 ATK!

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:15.040
Talkback Lancer is next to its link!

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:19.510
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card, Link Atrocity!

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:28.920
By tributing one Link Monster this turn, 
a Link Monster gains that monster's ATK.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.490
I tribute Talkback Lancer!

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:34.500
Talkback Lancer has 1700 ATK.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:39.970
So Excode Talker's ATK rises to 4000!

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:43.850
I see.  You're going for mutual destruction.

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:49.260
You say your dueling always wins, 
but your strategy is improvised-

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:50.170
Let's battle!

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:54.750
Excode Talker attacks Sunavalon Dryatrentiay!

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:05.160
Fine!  With mutual destruction, 
you'll never get to Revolver!

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:08.130
I accomplished my goal!

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.900
You're wrong.  Your goal is gone.

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:13.360
What?

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:17.760
I told you.  My dueling always wins.

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:22.000
The spell card Link Atrocity's 
additional effect!

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:25.600
When my monster attacks your Link Monster...

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:32.550
...your Link Monster loses 400 ATK for 
each Link Monster in our graveyards!

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:36.020
400 each?

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:39.490
There are fourteen Link 
Monsters in our graveyards!

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:42.860
F-Fourteen?

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:46.390
So your mommy's ATK is...

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:48.730
Zero!

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.040
This is the end!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:54.230
Excode Close!

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:11.430
I can't believe I lost.

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:18.330
Instead of letting you provoke me, I 
should've let you fall with the bridge.

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:24.970
I didn't expect my loyalty 
to Revolver would backfire.

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:28.130
But I don't regret a thing.

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:32.110
Playmaker, how about you?

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:36.080
I told you.  I'll no longer have doubt.

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:43.210
Doubt and regret may be different things.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:55.090
This looks bad!  Let's go!

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:56.000
Yeah.

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:06.310
Revolver, I'm sorry for being incompetent.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:42.390
Mother...

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:51.340
The bridge!

00:21:51.340 --> 00:21:52.860
Hurry, Playmaker!

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:55.030
The bridge is falling!

00:22:08.850 --> 00:22:15.670
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:22.810
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:30.040
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:37.390
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:44.630
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:48.780
There were fragments of power

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:55.960
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:56.190 --> 00:23:03.300
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:03.430 --> 00:23:10.480
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:10.730 --> 00:23:17.710
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:17.840 --> 00:23:24.590
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:25.280 --> 00:23:32.260
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:36.570 --> 00:23:41.600
Completing the Tower of Hanoi 
will lead to many victims.

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:49.650
Even if I can evacuate, I'm willing to 
tarnish my name for my fallen teammates.

00:23:49.650 --> 00:23:55.070
I must kill the Ignis to 
avoid the death of humanity.

00:23:55.690 --> 00:23:59.300
I will carry on my father's will!

00:23:59.850 --> 00:24:03.280
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Hanoi's Recollection

00:24:03.280 --> 00:24:05.340
Into the VRAINS!
